{"id": "Deef5PIlL6B", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "India's LTCG tax is 12.5%. For a foreign investor it can really work out to about 27%. Here's the catch 👇\n\nA fund makes 15% on an Indian stock. The rupee falls about 8%, so in dollars it made only about 6.5%. But the tax is charged on the full rupee gain, and 12.5% of that eats about 27% of the real, dollar gain.\n\nThat's why the FM saying she's open to views on LTCG and STT moved the market.\n\nNot investment advice. Send this to your investor friend 📈\n\n#ltcg #stockmarket #nifty #investing #personalfinance", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1791984787, "like_count": 7, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140051701575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 60.801, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN4gLbfUnHOm7MQepjGuxmd2nLUqSrO6v3qYfmwHoxbfYEx6xD4iaQ6Y5liO1ysMrd2UolHSJ_4Lvj65PnKWe9G2FARBDFGgN5FP6g.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=AdpVyApKJG2OrQ_xXpZCgvDeAnwPwTGTVdymfMslGbx1HzgEnACuvTtieYLRUR812y3GBK2B_SJnQoRDut76yhyq&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=4b-l-xZDb9wQ7kNvwHXEvDL&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=X5H11ARDKVGm8kUpkJuTTw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRzFiHG3Mg6dEY3ocEGi5GAsLF2-U69IW7oXFW0OZVfwg&oe=6AF449E4", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 60.801, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "h